    <bpmn:process id="W_W1907" name="W1907. Customer Complaint Root Cause Analysis &amp; Voice of Customer (VOC) Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly complaint data aggregation
Frequency: Monthly analysis; quarterly deep-dive
Volume: ~2,000–5,000 customer complaints/month across all channels
Owner: Market Research Analyst
Participants: Market Research Analyst, VP Store Operations, Category Manager, VP Merchandising
Source: workflow W1907 — Customer Complaint Root Cause Analysis &amp; Voice of Customer (VOC) Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1907_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1907_Lane1" name="Market Research Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1907_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1907_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1907_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1907_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1907_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1907_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1907_Start3" name="Monthly complaint data aggregation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1907_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1907_Task4" name="Monthly: Market Research Analyst aggregates complaint data from all channels…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: Market Research Analyst aggregates complaint data from all channels: (a) in-store complaints (logged by CSR per W13.1), (b) call center complaints (logged by customer service), (c) email complaints, (d) social media complaints (Facebook, Instagram, Twitter mentions), (e) ecommerce reviews and ratings, (f) categorize complaints: product quality, pricing, staff behavior, store cleanliness, out-of-stock, delivery, returns, wait time, others
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1907_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1907_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1907_Task5" name="Root cause analysis: (a) top 10 complaint categories by volume and severity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Root cause analysis: (a) top 10 complaint categories by volume and severity, (b) complaint rate per store: identify stores with complaint rates &gt; 2× chain average, (c) Pareto analysis: 80% of complaints from which 20% of causes?, (d) trend analysis: are complaint volumes increasing or decreasing by category?, (e) specific product complaints: SKUs with highest complaint rates for Category Manager review, (f) staff behavior complaints: identify specific stores or departments for targeted training
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1907_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1907_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1907_Task6" name="Quarterly deep-dive: (a) Market Research Analyst presents comprehensive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quarterly deep-dive: (a) Market Research Analyst presents comprehensive complaint analysis to VP Store Operations, VP Merchandising, and CMO, (b) identify systemic issues (process, training, product, policy) vs. isolated incidents, (c) recommend specific corrective actions with measurable targets, (d) track corrective action effectiveness: did complaint rate decrease after intervention?
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst / CMO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1907_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1907_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1907_Task7" name="VOC integration: (a) integrate complaint insights with CSAT, NPS, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: VOC integration: (a) integrate complaint insights with CSAT, NPS, and post-purchase data for holistic customer experience view, (b) feed insights into relevant workflows: product quality → W1839, staff training → W41, pricing → W40, inventory availability → W4, (c) monthly VOC summary distributed to all department heads
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1907_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1907_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1907_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1907_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1907_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-373 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Satisfaction &amp; Experience Research (PA-44.1).) | - operational: Market Research Analyst review and approval gate
Owner: Market Research Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1907_Assoc10" sourceRef="W1907_Annotation9" targetRef="W1907_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
